{"id": 15, "name": "Eudora", "splash": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/mobile-legends/images/a/ab/Hero151-portrait.png/revision/latest?cb=20260129103005", "cls": ["Mage", ""], "specialty": ["Control", "Burst"], "difficulty": "10", "stats": ["10", "80", "80", "10"], "lanes": ["Mid Lane", ""], "story": "The elven mage who commands lightning at her fingertips to pierce prejudice and illuminate the path forward.", "skills": [{"name": "Superconductor", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_2_1_42/100_4ac316bbaf343836fdc741c84ca5da45.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "Eudora's skills inflict <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Superconductor</span> for 3s on non-minion units hit and can trigger additional effects against enemies affected by <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Superconductor</span>."}, {"name": "Forked Lightning", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_2_1_42/100_17018b4270f7fd04eb235499eb629861.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 5   Mana Cost: 60", "desc": "Eudora casts Forked Lightning in a fan-shaped area, dealing 275<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+100% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> (increased to 200% against minions) to enemies within.\n\nWhen hitting targets affected by <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Superconductor</span>, Eudora forms a lightning chain with the target, gaining 40% Movement Speed during the chain for up to 1s.\nThe lightning chain deals 10<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+4% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> over time and an additional 275<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+100% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> when it ends. If this hit lands, it reduces this skill's cooldown by 1.5s."}, {"name": "Ball Lightning", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_2_1_42/100_ee8360b2b38255f04226a627561564fe.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 21, "tagname": "CC", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}, {"tagid": 33, "tagname": "Damage", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 11   Mana Cost: 80", "desc": "Eudora hurls an orb of lightning at the target enemy, reducing their Magic Defense by 10 for 1.8s, dealing 300<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+50% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span>, and stunning them for 1s.\n\nIf the target is affected by <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Superconductor</span>, the lightning orb reduces the Magic Defense of nearby enemies, deals AOE damage centered on the target, and stuns all nearby enemies."}, {"name": "Thunder’s Wrath", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_2_1_42/100_d44b0dd173dce52af46ec6432c4ab287.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 31, "tagname": "Burst", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 32   Mana Cost: 130", "desc": "Eudora calls down a blast of lightning on the target area, dealing 600<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+160% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> to targets at the center. Then it strikes targets outside the center, dealing 300<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+100% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span>.\n\nEvery time Thunder's Wrath hits a target affected by <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Superconductor</span>, it triggers a <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Thunderburst</span> centered on the <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Superconductor</span> target after a short delay, dealing 330<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+110% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span>."}], "fullbuilds": [{"items": [{"name": "Arcane Boots", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_1a0d5709c23c25849cca889cb1303ecb.png"}, {"name": "Genius Wand", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com